    "short_description": "Fight Japanese-folklore-inspired Yokai in a ink-brush illustrated Dungeon Crawler! Set in the moonlit city of Ido, the world has blackened under the 'Ink of Ruin' disaster. Conscript &amp; customise your team of warriors as you venture deep into labyrinths and ink your destiny in a winding narrative...",
